{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37694","headline":"宜春再访芳公言公幽斋写怀叙事因赋长言 · 郑谷","name":"宜春再访芳公言公幽斋写怀叙事因赋长言","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"入门长恐先师在，香印纱灯似昔年。\n涧路萦回斋处远，松堂虚豁讲声圆。\n顷爲弟子曾同社，今忝星郎更契缘。\n顾渚一瓯春有味，中林话旧亦潸然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37694.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37694","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}